debug IsDebug true IsFinalRelease false IsPackagedBuild false
release IsDebug false IsFinalRelease false IsPackagedBuild false
final IsDebug false IsFinalRelease true IsPackagedBuild true
TransportLine's referenceSet (an unordered_set in every TransportLine): config::debug only
Rcu's writeLockCount (an atomic counter): config::debug only
BuildConstants' IsDebug = config::debug ? true : false: chosen by the configuration
